  "description": "Optional transport-agnostic control facade add-on for Orleans.Lattice whole-tree administration. Presents one discoverable, fail-closed control surface for tree-lifecycle administration by composing the existing single-responsibility facades - it wraps the schema control facade (Orleans.Lattice.Api.Schema) by delegation rather than re-implementing it. Registered separately; adds no transport behaviour of its own. Exposes a fail-closed capability probe; individual whole-tree lifecycle operations are added to the facade as they become available.",
